金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">钴</span><span class=\"tag\">刚果</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"AI 检测的本质是作者识别，模板信博弈已失效 AI 检测的本质是大规模作者识别，而非抓取「AI 味」。真正被冲击的是依赖「写信必须花人工」的社会流程——征信申诉、失业申请、拨款评审，摩擦一旦消失，制度就会超载。 Complex Systems Complex Systems How AI detection actually works, with Pangram’s Max Spero AI 检测 文本溯源 反垃圾 公共服务 编程职业 模型伦理 anti-memetic property mode collapse cognitive surplus dead internet theory Jevons Paradox humanizer\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-27-complexsys-ai-检测的本质是作者识别-模板信博弈已失效/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d5836ffb777d7c36-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:54</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Complex Systems</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>AI 检测的本质是作者识别，模板信博弈已失效</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI 检测的本质是大规模作者识别，而非抓取「AI 味」。真正被冲击的是依赖「写信必须花人工」的社会流程——征信申诉、失业申请、拨款评审，摩擦一旦消失，制度就会超载。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 检测</span><span class=\"tag\">文本溯源</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"开源模型经手五六层中介，EU AI Act 的问责缺口谁来补 开放权重不等于开放可信；开源模型经手五六层中介后责任归属模糊，EU AI Act 的豁免设计可能留下结构性问责缺口，欧洲需要分层责任与耐心资本。 The In-Between Tech and Trust Podcast The In-Between Tech and Trust Podcast Building Trustworthy Open Source AI - Sebnem Erener (EP 38) 开源 EU AI Act AI 治理 开源伦理 欧洲科技主权 责任链 zero trust open washing general purpose AI models layered responsibility\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-08-27-theinbetweente-开放权重不等于可信-五六个中介后谁来负责/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/99f7b27239fc36aa-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">23:46</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">The In-Between Tech and Trust Podcast</span>\n